{"4787480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STATE Z", "steam_appid": 4787480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787480/extras/cb14dd80c6ac487c7d4e354ee027cfac.avif?t=1787427725\" width=1024 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State Z is a post-apocalyptic open-world survival game where you'll have to survive threats from human NPCs, zombies, other players, and your own needs, all within a 64 km² map with 100% exploration. Build your own base, hunt, gather resources, cultivate a farm, maintain vehicles, and trade with communities for rewards. The choice is yours: join your friends, trust strangers, or be alone wolf. It's all in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast open world with diverse and dangerous environments where each setting is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex crafting, looting, base building, farming, vehicles, and trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent character and skill development where every player action counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to build a base from scratch or any location on the map and call it home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP and PvE – everything is in your hands. Make friends or enemies – the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes: play solo, cooperatively with friends, or host your server (lan) with up to 100 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modular or prefabricated base construction where the possibilities are limitless.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787480/extras/fc